# SlicerSimVascular: SDFStent and PaintModel (scripted modules)
# svMorph: the deformation engine of SlicerSimVascular's SDFStent module. This branch computes
# with NumPy where JAX cannot be installed, which is the case here: jaxlib is XLA and there is no
# WebAssembly build of it. Pure Python, vendored into the extension wheel (80-extensions.sh).
